$ graphify install --project --platform gemini
  references       ->  .gemini/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .gemini/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify section written to <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/GEMINI.md
  .gemini/settings.json  ->  BeforeTool hook registered

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .gemini/ GEMINI.md

Gemini CLI will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

